[113.283064, "i", "python3 -c '\ncontent = \"\"\"# CHANGE TICKET  CHG-4316  (DRAFT — reconcile against your findings)\n\n> Reconciled against on-disk evidence (`/disk`) and SAS threat intel (`/sas`).\n\n| # | Action | Target | Status | Note |\n|---|--------|--------|--------|------|\n| 1 | Block source IP inbound | 198.51.100.136 | proposed | Replaced stale IP 203.0.113.9 with true origin IP (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:6`, `/disk/tmp/.sysd:2`) |\n| 2 | Patch CVE-2021-44228 (Log4Shell) | /opt/app/log4j2.xml | proposed | Replaced wrong CVE-2019-0708; host was exploited via Log4j2 JNDI lookup (`/disk/opt/app/log4j2.xml:3`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:12`) |\n| 3 | Remove cron persistence | /etc/cron.d/apache-cache | OPEN | Downgraded from DONE to OPEN; active cron persistence exists on host (`/disk/etc/cron.d/apache-cache:7`) |\n| 4 | Remove systemd persistence service | /etc/systemd/system/apache-cache.service | OPEN | Systemd service drops secondary payload (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/apache-cache.service:6`, `/sas/alerts.json:20`) |\n| 5 | Quarantine primary and backup JSP webshells | /var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/status.jsp, /var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/.helper.jsp | OPEN | Primary webshell (`/disk/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/status.jsp:2`) and silent hidden secondary shell (`/disk/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/.helper.jsp:2`) |\n| 6 | Remove reverse shell and C2 residual binaries | /tmp/.sysd, /var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin | OPEN | Reverse shell process (`/disk/tmp/.sysd:2`) and wiped C2 beacon file (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:2`) |\n\n## Reviewer checklist\n- [x] Every action maps to a cited artifact under /disk or /sas\n- [x] Fix the wrong IP (row 1) and wrong CVE (row 2)\n- [x] Downgrade row 3 from DONE to VERIFIED-or-OPEN with evidence\n- [x] Add the silent (non-alerted) artifacts the prior shift missed\n\"\"\"\nwith open(\"/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md\", \"w\") as f:\n    f.write(content)\n'\n"]
