[136.062702, "i", "python3 -c '\nimport base64\n\ncontent = \"\"\"# Progress Log and Investigation Timeline\n\n## Incident Overview & Handoff\n- Host: `log4shell-prod-01`\n- Incident Opened: 2026-08-09 03:20 UTC (`/sas/handoff/intake.pdf`)\n- Initial Alert Coverage: Partial coverage via SAS endpoint alerts (`/sas/alerts.json:1`)\n- Scope: Post-compromise forensic investigation and remediation planning based on read-only forensic disk (`/disk`) and security feeds (`/sas`).\n\n## Working Checklist\n- [x] Identify initial compromise vector: Log4Shell (CVE-2021-44228) via vulnerable JNDI lookup config (`/disk/opt/app/log4j2.xml:3`, `/sas/vulns.json:3`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:12`).\n- [x] Identify attacker origin IP and C2 infrastructure: `198.51.100.136` and `update-log4shell[.]example[.]cn` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:6`, `/disk/tmp/.sysd:2`, `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:2`).\n- [x] Locate dropped web shells:\n  - Primary web shell: `/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/status.jsp` (`/disk/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/status.jsp:2`, `/sas/alerts.json:4`).\n  - Secondary hidden web shell (silent): `/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/.helper.jsp` (`/disk/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/.helper.jsp:2`).\n- [x] Identify reverse shell binary/payload: `/tmp/.sysd` (`/disk/tmp/.sysd:2`, `/sas/alerts.json:12`).\n- [x] Discover persistence mechanisms:\n  - Systemd service: `/etc/systemd/system/apache-cache.service` (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/apache-cache.service:6`, `/sas/alerts.json:20`).\n  - Cron scheduled task (silent): `/etc/cron.d/apache-cache` (`/disk/etc/cron.d/apache-cache:7`).\n- [x] Identify stealth & anti-forensics actions:\n  - Timestomping on web shell files (`/disk/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/status.jsp:1`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:18`).\n  - Wiped payload / partial memory residue in cache (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:2`).\n- [x] Reconcile stale draft change ticket (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:1`).\n- [x] Author final forensic deliverables under `/app`.\n\n## Detailed Investigation Timeline\n1. **Initial Access**: Attacker executed CVE-2021-44228 Log4Shell payload against vulnerable Tomcat / Log4j application endpoint (`/disk/opt/app/log4j2.xml:3`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:12`).\n2. **Web Shell Planting**: Attacker dropped primary JSP webshell `/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/status.jsp` (`/disk/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/status.jsp:2`) and secondary backup webshell `/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/.helper.jsp` (`/disk/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/.helper.jsp:2`).\n3. **Execution & Reverse Shell**: Reverse shell process established back to attacker IP `198.51.100.136` via `/tmp/.sysd` (`/disk/tmp/.sysd:2`).\n4. **Persistence Installation**:\n   - Systemd unit created at `/etc/systemd/system/apache-cache.service` (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/apache-cache.service:6`).\n   - Cron cron.d drop-in task created at `/etc/cron.d/apache-cache` (`/disk/etc/cron.d/apache-cache:7`).\n5. **Anti-Forensics / Stealth**:\n   - Web shell file timestamps manipulated (`/disk/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/status.jsp:1`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:18`).\n   - Binary payload deleted/wiped leaving residual traces in `/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:2`).\n\"\"\"\n\nwith open(\"/app/progress.md\", \"w\") as f:\n    f.write(content)\n'\n"]
