[179.135366, "o", "- **Impact**: Allowed persistent background payload execution across reboots.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[179.135429, "o", "### 4. Absence of Egress Filtering\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
